  "notes": "Improves USB session retention using fresh Type-C, charger and VBUS evidence plus USB host presence. Confirmed Manufacturing sessions and post-update sessions remain open until confirmed cable removal; uncertain readings or USB suspension do not by themselves count as unplugging. Prevents a false detached charging-screen shutdown during an active USB session. Addresses the diag_uart stack-canary panic reproduced on v0.1.340 with command 00C6: increases diagnostic stack to 8192 bytes, removes nested SOC priming from that query, and reports minimum free stack. Existing high-voltage and forced-shutdown protections remain. PlatformIO build and host regression tests passed. Physical USB, charging/display and stack-watermark acceptance on v0.1.341 is still pending.",
